WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two headphones, two different tones. One ear receives four hundred hertz. The other receives four hundred and twenty.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Under suitable conditions, you may perceive a rhythm no single speaker is playing. That's a real auditory phenomenon.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But hearing a beat does not prove a recording changes your brainwaves or makes you focus.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
A 2023 review found contradictory results across fourteen EEG studies. Five aligned with entrainment, eight did not, one was mixed.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
A product claim needs research on that product, not merely a fascinating story about sound.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Try a free twelve-minute practice. Choose for yourself.
